{room, key=club_malloc_storage, name=Storage
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }
    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
South: exit the storage room
        }
    }

    {enter_message
        {act, logic=story, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {story
        {message
            output={@

Dozens of wires are spilling out from missing panels in the ceiling.
Parts of it are glitching and not rendering properly.
It appears that this room is a bit buggy and its definitions not quite
coded properly.

There is nothing but junk surrounding you.

            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@

Wires are everywhere, along the walls and spilling out of missing panels
in the ceiling overhead. They are tangled and disorganized.
You can't tell what they might be connected to.

Small dim lights illuminate the chaotically packed store room.
Parts of it are glitching and not rendering properly.
It appears that this room is a bit buggy and its definitions not quite
coded properly.

There is nothing but junk surrounding you.

            }
        }

        {logic, name=Storage tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }


    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }


    {inject, logic=./objects/wires.inj }




    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_south))
        {move, logic=club_malloc, tags=[player]
            output={@

You exit the storage room.

            }
        }
    }



    {dev_note, tags=Testing, active=true
        output={@
[ ] : Room
[ ] : Look
[ ] : Story
>   [ ] : Wires

[ ] : Navigation
        }
    }
}
